---
const priorities = [
  { number: "01", title: "A dependable core", detail: "Rust execution, inspectable telemetry, and human approval gates form the foundation." },
  { number: "02", title: "Context that stays close", detail: "Desktop observability and private memory keep your team connected to agent decisions." },
  { number: "03", title: "Connected local workflows", detail: "Mesh discovery and coordination support the direction toward work across local nodes." },
  { number: "04", title: "Deeper governance", detail: "Continued work on audit records, operational controls, and governed multi-agent execution." },
];
---

<section id="roadmap" class="roadmap-section" aria-labelledby="roadmap-title">
  <div class="section-shell">
    <div class="roadmap-intro"><div><span class="eyebrow">Engineering direction</span><h2 id="roadmap-title" class="section-heading">A foundation.<br />Built to go further.</h2></div><p class="section-copy">Follow the work in the open. These focus areas describe the project's direction; the source repository is the reference for available features and releases.</p></div>
    <ol class="roadmap-grid">{priorities.map((item) => <li><span class="roadmap-number">{item.number}<span aria-hidden="true"></span></span><h3>{item.title}</h3><p>{item.detail}</p></li>)}</ol>
    <a href="https://github.com/DDS-Solutions/AI-TadPole-OS/releases" class="roadmap-link">Explore releases on GitHub <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .roadmap-section { scroll-margin-top: 7rem; padding: clamp(3rem, 5vw, 5rem) 0; border-block: 1px solid var(--line); background: #0b100d80; }
  .roadmap-intro { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.12fr .88fr; align-items: end; gap: 4rem; margin-bottom: 3.5rem; }
  .roadmap-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 2rem; }
  .roadmap-number { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem; font: .65rem var(--font-mono); color: #6ee7b7; }
  .roadmap-number > span { flex: 1; height: 1px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #6ee7b730, #ffffff08); }
  h3 { font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -.03em; color: #e4eee8; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
  li > p { font-size: .8rem; line-height: 1.85; color: #9ca9a1; margin-top: .85rem; }
  .roadmap-link { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 1.5rem; min-height: 44px; margin-top: 2rem; color: #a7f3d0; font-size: .75rem; }
  .roadmap-link:hover { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 4px; }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .roadmap-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 2rem; } }
  @media (max-width: 700px) { .roadmap-intro { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1.3rem; margin-bottom: 2.5rem; } }
  @media (max-width: 479px) { .roadmap-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1.75rem; } h3 { margin-top: 1rem; } }
</style>
